# Audeo Release Notes

## 0.5.0 (14 Feb 2026)

### 🚀 Major Features
- **🔄 Auto-Update System**: Complete automatic update mechanism
  - Added comprehensive `update.py` module with GitHub API integration
  - Multi-platform asset detection (Windows .exe/.msi, macOS .dmg, Linux .AppImage)
  - Version comparison and update availability checking
  - Built-in download manager with progress tracking
  - Cross-platform file opening for update installers

### 📦 Technical Changes
- **🆕 Update Module**: New `update.py` with 278 lines of robust update functionality
  - `UpdateCheckResult` dataclass for structured update information
  - Resilient GitHub API fetching with multiple fallback strategies
  - Platform-specific asset scoring and selection
  - Download progress callbacks and error handling
  - Cross-platform file operations (Windows Explorer, macOS Finder, Linux xdg-open)

### 🔧 Improvements
- **🛡️ Error Resilience**: Enhanced GitHub API handling with multiple fallback strategies
- **🎯 Smart Asset Selection**: Platform-aware asset prioritization (installers > portable)
- **📊 Progress Tracking**: Real-time download progress with chunked transfers
- **🌐 Cross-Platform**: Native file manager integration for all supported platforms

### 🐛 Bug Fixes
- Improved version parsing consistency across different version string formats
- Enhanced error handling for network requests and API failures
- Better timeout management for update downloads

---

## 0.4.0 (13 Feb 2026)

### 🏗️ Architecture Improvements
- **🔧 Robust Navigation System**: Implemented language-independent view navigation
  - Added `ViewName` enum for type-safe view identifiers
  - Replaced hardcoded French strings with constants
  - Enhanced maintainability and future extensibility

### 🌍 Internationalization Enhancements
- **📝 Complete String Translation**: All remaining hardcoded strings now use translation system
  - Fixed untranslated error messages in `widgets.py`
  - Updated error dialogs in `FinishedDownloadCard`
  - Enhanced video info view with proper translations

### 🔒 Security & Validation
- **🛡️ Proxy URL Validation**: Added comprehensive proxy URL format validation
  - Validates http/https scheme requirements
  - Checks hostname presence and port validity (1-65535)
  - Automatic correction with user-friendly error handling

### 📦 Technical Changes
- **🆕 Constants Module**: Created dedicated `constants.py` for application-wide constants
- **🔨 Code Quality**: Improved type safety and reduced language dependencies
- **✅ Testing**: All changes validated with compilation and runtime tests

### 🐛 Bug Fixes
- Fixed navigation system dependency on translated strings
- Resolved untranslated error messages throughout the application
- Improved proxy configuration validation and error handling

---

